    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nBright and spacious, 2 Bed 2 bath, first floor apartment\nOpen plan kitchen / living area with doors to false balcony\nModern kitchen with ample storage\n2 large double bedrooms with primary bedroom ensuite\nLarge family bathroom with shower over bath\nAdditional communal parking to the side and front of the block\nSecure underground parking with lift access to the block\nElectric Storage heating and Double-glazed windows\nWithin the Castlemill development with Dunnestores as anchor tenants in the shopping centre\nMins drive to M1 motorway with easy access to Dublin airport and city centre\n\n\n24 Castlemill is a bright and spacious first-floor apartment, ideally positioned within the popular Castlemill development in Balbriggan. Offering well-proportioned accommodation throughout, this attractive two-bedroom, two-bathroom property presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike.\nThe heart of the home is the generous open-plan kitchen and living area, creating a welcoming space for both everyday living and entertaining. The modern kitchen is well appointed with ample storage, while glazed doors from the living area open onto a false balcony, allowing plenty of natural light into the room and providing an attractive outlook.\nThere are two large double bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from the added convenience of a private ensuite shower room. A generously sized family bathroom completes the accommodation and features a shower over the bath. Double-glazed windows and electric storage heating further enhance the comfort and efficiency of the property.\nResidents also benefit from excellent parking facilities, including secure underground parking with lift access directly to the block, as well as additional communal parking to the front and side of the development. The apartment is situated within the established Castlemill development, which incorporates a shopping centre with Dunnes Stores as its anchor tenant, providing a range of everyday amenities close to home.\nThe location is particularly convenient for commuters, with the M1 motorway just a few minutes' drive away, providing easy access to Dublin Airport and Dublin city centre. Balbriggan itself offers a wide selection of local amenities, schools, recreational facilities and transport links, making this an appealing location for both owner-occupiers and investors.\nOverall, 24 Castlemill combines bright and spacious accommodation with excellent on-site facilities and a highly convenient location. Early viewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this well-presented apartment has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.25m x 1.05m\nwith wood flooring and large storage room\n\nKitchen - 2.85m x 1.65\nwith tiled flooring, modern fitted kitchen and built in hob, over and extractor fan and plumbed for washing machine and fridge freezer.\n\nLiving Room - 3.44m x 5.35\nwith wood flooring, large windows and door to false balcony.\n\nBedroom One - 3.1m x 4.15\nwith wood flooring, build in wardrobes, ensuite shower room\n\nBedroom Two - 2.47m x 4.2m\nwith wood flooring and built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 2.18m x 1.68m\nwith tiled flooring and walls behind bath, wc and whb.\n\n"
      },
